  "content": "<h1><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>经典主机版教程世界合集</strong></span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我创建了一个合集，收集了&nbsp;</span><a style=\"font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fLegacy_Console_Edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">经典主机版 (Legacy Console Edition)</a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">的所有教程世界。这里包含了从 TU1 到 TU69 的所有教程世界，并且也包含了迷你游戏大厅：</span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu1\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU1</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu3\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU3</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu5\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU5</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu7\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU7</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu9\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU9</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu12\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU12</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu14\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU14</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu19\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU19</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu31\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU31</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu46\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU46</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu69\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU69</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252fmini-game-maps%252f2016-mini-game-lobby\" rel=\"nofollow\">2016 迷你游戏大厅</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252fmini-game-maps%252f2017-mini-game-lobby\" rel=\"nofollow\">2017 迷你游戏大厅</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">这些教程世界可以更新到 Java 版的最新版本，并且还有一个 Bedrock 版也可以更新到最新版本。</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:18px\">鸣谢：</strong></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252fcredits\" rel=\"nofollow\">由 The Architect of Minecraft 转换和更新</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><em>这些世界非常古老，已移植到其他版本，因此可能包含错误且不稳定。</em></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
